The Monday weekly summary gets one line when N > 0: „ამ თვეში N წევრს
დაეხმარე." N is the thank-yous this person received in the last 30 days
(helper_thanks.thanked_at, 1692). Nothing else: no ranking, no comparison, no
points; at zero the line is absent. A failed count is zero, never a failed
summary. The bridge role joins with 1692 part 2.

